<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 6.3 points to 788.9 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 6.3 points to 788.9 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 6.3 points, or 0.81 percent, on Thursday to 788.9, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Five of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the machinery index rising the most, up 14.6 points, or 1.39 percent, to 1,062.7 points.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
